      "id": "msg_0496_T07R0103_CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_3F_Text_OTStandsForOriginalTrainer",
      "en_US": [
        "Captured Pokémon are registered\n",
        "with an ID No. and the Ot.\r",
        "Ot stands for “Original Trainer” -\n",
        "the Trainer that caught it first."
      ]
    },
    {
